OL,3,GNEWSAAnxiety for traders over market's
OL,4,Arelocation
OL,5,
OL,6,FRelocating Worcester's outdoor market
OL,7,Fcould turn out to be a "bad idea",
OL,8,Faccording to some traders who say they
OL,9,Fare against the idea.
OL,11,FIt will move from Angel Place to the
OL,12,FCornmarket from September, after it was
OL,13,Fgiven a last-minute reprieve, amid
OL,14,Fdoubts about its future.
OL,16,FBut stallholders said they were worried
OL,17,Fcustom could drop off, citing concerns
OL,18,Fabout it being further from the bus
OL,19,Fstation.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
