OL,3,GNEWSAAnxiety for traders over market's
OL,4,Arelocation
OL,5,
OL,6,FAdrian Wheatley, who sells perfumes,
OL,7,Fsaid: "It should be left where it is -
OL,8,Fyou can't get a better location than
OL,9,Fthis." The new operator of the market,
OL,10,FBluebell, said it was committed "to
OL,11,Fgiving Worcester a high-quality weekly
OL,12,Fmarket".
